{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "sync-v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.04, "to": 0.98, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "问你一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.98, "to": 2.58, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "达瓦看准星还是看人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.58, "to": 4.34, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "大部分人可能会说有人看人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.34, "to": 5.24, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "没人看准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.24, "to": 6.28, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "但是如果我告诉你", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.28, "to": 7.52, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "这样其实并不全对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.52, "to": 10.38, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "有更好的方式能够帮助你提升对枪水平呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.38, "to": 12.22, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "欢迎来到本期的顿悟焚诀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.22, "to": 16.66, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "今天的影片2分钟就告诉你达瓦时不同场景的专注点应当在哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.66, "to": 17.46, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "首先我想讲的是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.46, "to": 19.5, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "很多玩家把看准星给理解错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.5, "to": 22.0, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "看准星并不是要死死的盯住准星锁住", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 22.0, "to": 23.9, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "而是要有一种娓娓锁定的感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.9, "to": 25.0, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "不要太过紧绷", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.0, "to": 27.32, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "不然会很容易出现敌人进入你的屏幕内", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.32, "to": 28.86, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "你由于过度聚焦准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.86, "to": 30.2, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛无法快速看清", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.2, "to": 31.28, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "拉出敌人的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.28, "to": 32.96, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "那很多玩家说自己看不清人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.96, "to": 34.489, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "也非常可能是因为这一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.489, "to": 36.009, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "当然也不能过度放松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 36.009, "to": 37.409, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "否则也会出现别人拉出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.409, "to": 39.249, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "你愣半天才反应过来的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.249, "to": 43.64, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "最正确的感觉应该是你的视线专注在以准星为中心的一片区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.64, "to": 45.84, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以自己在训练场练习感受一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.84, "to": 47.06, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛看着准星附近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.06, "to": 48.1, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "然后放一个烟雾", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.1, "to": 49.04, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "走出来的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.04, "to": 51.52, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "看到人瞬间视角锁定到敌人头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.52, "to": 53.46, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "你会发现诶有一个新的感悟", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.46, "to": 54.92, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "好理解完上述的内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.92, "to": 56.64, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "接下来我们用实战片段来讲解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.64, "to": 59.12, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "疫苗分为平滑预瞄和分段式预瞄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.12, "to": 60.56, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "我们在平滑预瞄的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.56, "to": 62.88, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "视线专注在准星这一片区域即可", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.88, "to": 64.52, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "但是在透墙的分段式预瞄时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.52, "to": 67.04, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "就需要把注意力专注在墙后的那一片区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.04, "to": 67.96, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "当你拉出去时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.96, "to": 70.44, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "才不会因为看准星而导致开枪慢一拍", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.44, "to": 73.86, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "同样架枪也是你在架枪时不需要去盯着准星看", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.86, "to": 76.31, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "而是要专注在架枪的那一片区域", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 76.31, "to": 79.43, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "就像准星和场景是两个不同的平面一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.43, "to": 83.05, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "那剩下的情况就是见到敌人就专注在敌人的头身上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.05, "to": 83.99, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "最后提醒一下大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.99, "to": 86.26, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "每个人都会有一些不一样的思路跟习惯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.26, "to": 89.36, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "我给出的思路也只是我认为最符合大部分玩家的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.36, "to": 90.82, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "如果你使用我说的这种方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 90.82, "to": 93.18, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "熟悉一段时间后觉得水平确实有提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.18, "to": 94.7, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "那我非常高兴有帮助到你", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.7, "to": 97.1, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "如果你使用过后发现实在适应不了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.1, "to": 98.36, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "也可以求同存异", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.36, "to": 102.0, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "但PS真正的秘诀就是如何让自己处于最舒服的状态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 102.0, "to": 103.4, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "我讲的不一定是最好的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.4, "to": 106.52, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "但是你可以吸收理解后转化为更适合自己的", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV1uHnqzxEv7", "title": "瞄准时该看哪里？正确的注意力认知能让你的枪法产生质变![顿悟焚绝#3]", "owner": "姚大韬yTao", "duration": 107}